
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Websites, dashboards &amp; custom tools</span>
        <h1>Customers can&rsquo;t find you, or nobody sees the numbers? <em>We fix that too.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead hero__say">Not every problem needs AI: a website that brings in enquiries, a dashboard that ends the weekly spreadsheet, or a tool built around how you work. <b>Each at a fixed price.</b></p>
        <div class="btn-row page-head__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="services-book-top">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="start" data-track="services-estimate">Get an estimate</a>
        </div>
        <nav class="service-nav" aria-label="Jump to a service" style="justify-content:flex-start">
          <a href="#websites">Customers can&rsquo;t find us · from <span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></a>
          <a href="#dashboards">Nobody sees the numbers · from <span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></a>
          <a href="#software">Off-the-shelf doesn&rsquo;t fit · from <span data-zar="45000">R45,000</span></a>
          <a href="ai-for-business">Retyping and admin → Solutions</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WEBSITES -->
    <section class="service" id="websites" aria-labelledby="websitesTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></span>
          <span class="eyebrow">Customers can&rsquo;t find you, or can&rsquo;t get in touch</span>
          <h2 id="websitesTitle">Websites</h2>
          <p class="lead">Fast, professional websites built around what you want visitors to do — call, WhatsApp, book or buy.</p>
          <p class="with-ai"><b>With AI:</b> enquiries from the site are read, sorted and answered for a person to approve. <a class="inline-link" href="ai-demos#calls">See it work &rarr;</a></p>
          <ul class="price-list" style="margin:0.8rem 0 0.4rem">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Business Website<small>Custom design, up to 8 pages, content and SEO set-up · ~2–3 weeks</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Platform or Web App<small>Bookings, payments, client logins, linked to your tools</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></span></li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Your site has to do a job: win enquiries, take bookings or serve clients.</li>
            <li>Your current site is slow, dated or hard to update.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.9rem">Changes later: <span data-zar="1250">R1,250</span> an hour.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card">
            <h4>Starting price</h4>
            <span class="price"><small>From</small><span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></span>
            <p class="small muted">Usually live in 2&ndash;3 weeks.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="start?type=Website" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a website project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service section--tint" id="dashboards" aria-labelledby="dashboardsTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></span>
          <span class="eyebrow">The numbers live in five spreadsheets</span>
          <h2 id="dashboardsTitle">Dashboards</h2>
          <p class="lead">Your spreadsheets and systems, turned into one screen you can actually read.</p>
          <p class="with-ai"><b>With AI:</b> the dashboard writes a short summary of what changed this week, so nobody has to. <a class="inline-link" href="ai-demos#insight">See a similar one &rarr;</a></p>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Someone rebuilds the same report every week or month.</li>
            <li>Your data lives across spreadsheets that never quite agree.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card"><h4>Starting price</h4><span class="price"><small>From</small><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span><p class="small muted">More sources cost more.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>Bring your data</h4><p>A spreadsheet or export is enough to start.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Dashboard" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a dashboard project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CUSTOM SOFTWARE -->
    <section class="service" id="software" aria-labelledby="softwareTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6l-6 6 6 6"/><path d="M16 6l6 6-6 6"/><path d="M14 4l-4 16"/></svg></span>
          <span class="eyebrow">Your tools don&rsquo;t fit how you work</span>
          <h2 id="softwareTitle">Custom Software</h2>
          <p class="lead">When off-the-shelf doesn't fit, we build the tool that works your way — nothing you don't need.</p>
          <p class="with-ai"><b>With AI:</b> documents are read and the data entered into your systems for you. <a class="inline-link" href="ai-demos#systems">See it work &rarr;</a></p>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>You pay for software that does only part of what you need.</li>
            <li>The business has outgrown Excel, WhatsApp and paper.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card"><h4>Starting price</h4><span class="price"><small>From</small><span data-zar="45000">R45,000</span></span><p class="small muted">We start small and grow it.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Custom%20Software" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a software project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AI & AUTOMATION: now the main offer -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="ai" aria-labelledby="aiTitle">
      <div class="container band" id="automation">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">AI &amp; automation</span>
          <h2 id="aiTitle">Automating a process? That&rsquo;s our main work.</h2>
          <p class="lead">Enquiries, invoices, data entry and reports, taken off your team step by step.</p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="ai-for-business">See the solutions</a>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="pricing#implementation">Implementation pricing</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--dark" aria-labelledby="unsureTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Not sure which one you need?</span>
        <h2 id="unsureTitle">You don't have to pick a category.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin:1rem auto 1.6rem">Describe the problem. We&rsquo;ll suggest the simplest fix.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="services-final-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="start" class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--large" data-track="services-final-estimate">Get an estimate</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small" style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--text-muted)">Not ready to talk? <a class="inline-link" href="ai-demos">Try the examples →</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

